  "description": "Ibercon is an annual Spanish furry convention, an international furcon aimed mainly at the Spanish and Portuguese furry communities and more broadly at the European fandom, with a name that references the Iberian Peninsula. It is jointly organized by the Asociación para la Cultura Furry Española and the Associação Eufurria of Portugal, and programming is mainly in Spanish and English, with some Portuguese and translation for all activities. It was announced on October 20, 2024, and the first Ibercon was held May 1 to 4, 2025, at Rafael Hoteles Atocha in Madrid.",
